{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1427.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"5d66231369407e490af9e20a5e19e57f55a3c58ec777df89d7fbec91e37f478c","ja":"撮影お疲れ様でした。\nあずささんも、このまま劇場に戻りますか？","zh":"拍摄辛苦了。\n梓小姐也打算就这样回剧场吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1427.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"799540094259de98d123848149a67811d7e7f3835d562af57baa4caef4e4ad7c","ja":"私はちょっと寄りたいところがあって。\n練習中のみんなに、差し入れを買って帰ろうかなって。","zh":"我有点想顺便去个地方。\n想给大家买点慰问品带回去，大家现在正在练习呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1427.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"0175b21badd196910614235acdaf6723f22266339b6aaa1ac8c53e71cf06b637","ja":"みんなすごく頑張ってましたね。\n私たちの公演に負けないように、と。","zh":"大家都非常努力呢。\n说是为了不输给我们的演出。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1427.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"19c9169b541d6f8085acdcca47f4f22c18f5e9bc80bd7c6e1002f3958d72c00a","ja":"そうなの。だから甘いものを食べて、\n英気を養ってもらいたくって。","zh":"是呀。所以想让你吃点甜食，\n好好恢复一下精力。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1427.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"8ea6dbaf4bd63b504102e1c4e5e740a46c2e29270a42018a7683e1f19a146a51","ja":"スタッフさんに聞いたら、\n近所のケーキ屋さんを教えていただいたの。","zh":"问了工作人员之后，\n对方告诉了我附近的一家蛋糕店。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1427.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"ea31a66228c9aa6777a686c0fc26b48841fc130f75906dc236145a474b3f940d","ja":"最近できたばかりのお店で、\nどれもとっても美味しいんですって！","zh":"是一家最近才开的新店，\n据说每样东西都非常好吃呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1427.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"afcc37923d4c0ba47e619a8c016234db0d9c41282cef1df221bfefdb0e5cd320","ja":"でしたら、私も一緒に。\n場所はわかりますか？","zh":"既然如此，我也一起去吧。\n你知道地方在哪里吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1427.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"cd71ff78bcf98ca63acccfe50cd910c8d61cd76acf863454b6516bf54a3b8555","ja":"ええ、もちろん！　ちゃんと地図を書いてきたから、\n任せてちょうだい！","zh":"嗯，当然了！我已经好好画好地图了，\n就交给我吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1427.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"3e23af320fd13c27a37ed97f5790cec7dcacd1ab8b6893d3e05439caaad4a914","ja":"まずは……この道をまっすぐね。\nさあ、行きましょう千早ちゃん♪","zh":"首先是……沿着这条路直走呢。\n来，我们出发吧，千早♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1427.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"e1618858720bcda9fd886abe21f7a67fb340ffee3155941c3ca17b7dd73037c6","ja":"はい。どんなお店なのか楽しみです。","zh":"好的。真期待会是怎样的一家店。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
