{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1427.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"4e6c131764e872004b4bad1762ff3b277505bb5fd9049eebdef27a20a68441be","ja":"あの……あずささん、\n元の場所に戻ったのでは……。","zh":"那个……梓小姐，\n是不是回到原来的地方了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1427.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"916098143efa15ca604e64cadd90bfa75a64cbd95ec0c773098f3736c0ebb9f2","ja":"おかしいわね～。\n地図のとおりに歩いてるはずなんだけど……？","zh":"奇怪呀～。\n明明应该是按照地图走的呀……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1427.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"e7f9c5ff15150a2d132c71fcde2dc75099f7e656d1e99b5433115e6c81dc45e6","ja":"その地図、ちょっと見せてもらえますか？","zh":"那张地图，能让我看一下吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1427.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"e04e1a9a0093c926a025caff039b90ddd71a4e12334e9536f524387ef2d34832","ja":"ええ。はい、どうぞ。","zh":"好的。来，请便。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1427.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"24def1e50f2cb040ed982d2dfd3b2f33d6789d8a43394d07c82ed2c6d8e288d3","ja":"えっと……この地図、少し違ってますね。\nあそこのコンビニと家電量販店は、逆ではないかと。","zh":"那个……这张地图，稍微有点不对呢。\n那边的便利店和家电大卖场，是不是反了呀。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1427.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"2748c3294337938f616cbef4473a1978c3beda949a5b935c4323f0b6ac36e811","ja":"あら、書き間違えちゃったのかしら？\nそれじゃあ、こっちなのかも……。","zh":"哎呀，是不小心写错了吗？\n既然这样，也许是这个……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1427.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"d4ddb58b971f8513573da8ee164ea226b269829bfa2e7cff5fa8b6276d4583a6","ja":"あ、待ってください。\n他にも、地図に気になるところが……。","zh":"啊，请等一下。\n地图上还有其他令人在意的地方……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
